## Conclusion

Common Table Expressions help organize complex SQL queries into readable steps. In this assignment, CTEs were used to select top records, calculate monthly sales, generate a sequence of dates, compare city-wise average ratings, and calculate team-wise runs.

Recursive CTEs are especially useful for generating sequences, while regular CTEs simplify grouping, filtering, and aggregation.

